Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:11.805 --> 00:00:16.520
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.267
Today we learn: Weather. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.955 --> 00:00:23.622
Sunny. Say it with me. Sunny!

6
00:00:27.121 --> 00:00:31.038
Rainy. Say it with me. Rainy!

7
00:00:34.548 --> 00:00:38.265
Cloudy. Say it with me. Cloudy!

8
00:00:41.745 --> 00:00:45.161
Hot. Say it with me. Hot!

9
00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:52.086
Cold. Say it with me. Cold!

10
00:00:55.568 --> 00:00:59.335
Windy. Say it with me. Windy!

11
00:01:02.856 --> 00:01:06.723
Umbrella. Say it with me. Umbrella!

12
00:01:10.201 --> 00:01:13.968
Season. Say it with me. Season!

13
00:01:17.469 --> 00:01:20.736
Weather. Say it with me. Weather!

14
00:01:24.253 --> 00:01:28.053
Forecast. Say it with me. Forecast!

15
00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:41.102
Grammar time! It is + adjective. Listen. It is sunny. It is windy today.

16
00:01:41.152 --> 00:01:47.021
Your turn. Say it with me. It is sunny. It is windy today.

17
00:01:51.786 --> 00:01:59.506
Today is sunny and hot, but yesterday was cloudy and cold. I always carry an umbrella in the rainy season.

18
00:01:59.556 --> 00:02:01.078
I like this story!

19
00:02:01.931 --> 00:02:07.330
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:08.530
Cloudy!

21
00:02:09.672 --> 00:02:15.032
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:15.082 --> 00:02:16.232
Umbrella!

23
00:02:17.369 --> 00:02:25.327
Think and answer. What is the weather like today where you live?

24
00:02:25.377 --> 00:02:26.527
Great answer!

25
00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:32.096
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
